{"parse": {"title": "“达泊一号”音带", "pageid": 54935, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"“达泊一号”音带\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6d/Antique-v1a9_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"“达泊一号”音带\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-501203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e8/Signature-501203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"186\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"190\" data-file-height=\"186\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">科算中心为纪念跨越“暴雨”而特别研发的赠品。以达泊兽电荷为原理研发的磁场留声机，现已达成对于物理失真现象的99.99965%的消除。<br />注：已为几位志愿者留声，可拨动旋钮收听。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：191001</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E9.99.84.E5.8A.A0.E5.89.A7.E6.83.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"附加剧情\">附加剧情</span></h2><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"transform:translateY(0); gap:20px; position:relative; flex-direction:row-reverse; margin-bottom:0.8em;\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很高兴我们一同跨越了“暴雨”。请收下科算中心的特别赠品，经由多次民主提案与驳回后遗留的唯一产物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请放心使用本音带。“达泊一号”已顺利完成出厂调试，清除了内部测试人员录制的一系列泄愤的嚎叫声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-302311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-302311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-302311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，您好。这样有些奇怪，就好像是……我在跟您通电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我知道一切仍未结束，时代仍在倒退……但这是一场值得庆祝的胜利，对吗？我会铭记这一天，希望您也能享受这场纪念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>啊——哈！咱们终于拥有了一个酷毙了的纪念日！不然本海盗正打算当场发明一个——就叫它“电台复活节”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>说实话，我一直觉得你的箱子里缺点儿真正有品位的东西。而现在，瞧瞧它——这台银色大耳朵音响——我非得在里头录下整套强尼·卡什的摇滚乐不可！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>这趟漫长的旅程不免让船长与各位朋友们稍感疲劳。依APPLe某之见，为了延续思维的保质期，我们需要一些闲暇时光来整理头绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我衷心期望这份慷慨的礼物不会录下APPLe某的酒后失言。那些“胡扯”……嗯……那些无根据的猜测与不合时宜的谈吐，它们本应与夜色一同消逝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-300411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>喂……维尔汀？嗯……这玩意儿可比芝诺那老掉牙的“抗、干、扰”通讯清晰多了——就是携带起来不太方便。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>备点儿我最爱的“生命之水”，再给自己和其他孩子们准备些果汁儿——你知道的，比起废话连篇的问候，我更擅长用力碰杯。</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91\" title=\"环日丰碑\"><img alt=\"环日丰碑.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg/500px-%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg/750px-%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg/1000px-%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n签到活动 - <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%AF%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%B0%E7%A2%91\" title=\"环日丰碑\">环日丰碑</a></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">“达泊一号”音带 <small style=\"color: grey\">\"Dalpo No.1\" Tape Recorder</small></span></span>"}}